<title>USA: Analysts' estimates for USDA Cattle on Feed report.</title>
<headline>Analysts' estimates for USDA Cattle on Feed report.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are analysts'</p>
<p>estimates for the monthly U.S. Agriculture Department's Cattle</p>
<p>on Feed report to be issued at 1400 CDT/1900 GMT Friday. (in</p>
<p>percent of a year ago)</p>
<p>  Seven-state 1,000 head		 Avg	  Ranges</p>
<p> On feed October 1			 94.8     93.0- 97.0</p>
<p> September placements		    98.6     96.0-104.0</p>
<p> September marketings		    87.9     85.0- 95.0</p>
</text>
